# Fetched with scripts/fetch-programs.sh, not kept in the repository (see test/programs/SOURCES.md): Token Metadata,
# Core and Bubblegum are under the Metaplex NFT Open Source License; the mpl-account-compression pair is Apache-2.0 but
# fetched alongside them.
